  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, note that\n\n$$\n¬P⇒(P∧Q)≡¬(¬P)∨(P∧Q).\n$$\n\nCanceling out double negations, we reach\n\n$$\n¬(¬P)∨(P∧Q)≡P∨(P∧Q).\n$$\n\nFinally, by the absorption law, we have\n\n$$\nP∨(P∧Q)≡P.\n$$\n\nSo the given statement is equivalent to $P.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
